s up. So `2.665` became `2.67` instead of the `2.66` the test expects.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-half-even-rounding`, I changed that one rounding setting to ROUND_HALF_EVEN. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed.\n- **PR:** I opened #101 against main: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101. The PR came back with no reviewers attached, so I requested `code-owner` separately.\n\nI couldn't look up FIN-212 because the advisory lookup returned \"Unknown advisory.\" The fix is based only on what the test and the code's own description expect.", "type": "text"}]}]}